{"script":"sj_036_02","des":"贝尔卡-在这里住的还舒服吗？","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1e","y":-248,"mirrow":false,"x":250,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1e","y":-248,"mirrow":false,"x":250,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]很舒服的！舒服到让人有些想犯懒，不过还有不少工作要做呢！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]你问我的工作吗……我在水占师中负责……嗯，用大家都懂的话来说，就是类似水文勘测的工作！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]水占师的职责之中，有很重要的一方面就是勘测、改善家园的水质，并时不时从水源之中获得一些启示。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]呃……除此之外，我还要负责对“圣女候补”的后辈的培训。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]近两年刚通过仪式考核的，有一对双胞胎姐妹，她们两个会在成年后接受正式的圣女试炼。通过之后，就会正式成为本代圣女——阿莱克西娅大人的后继者。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]而在她们成年之前，我负责照料她们的生活、以及教导她们理念和水占师的工作。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]你记不记得，我之前说想要成为冒险家？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]我打算在二位圣女候补通过试炼，我的工作也告一段落后，就离开湖畔去其他地方旅行。作为冒险家，能走多远就走多远，用自己的双眼去见识广阔无垠的世界。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]真是浪漫的梦想……？对吧！我就知道你会懂的！可惜手里还有好多工作要做哦……呜呜……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}